ak and non-specific: 'VISIT / ORDER TODAY' does not satisfy the brief's 'visit tonight' urgency or brand recall.","fix":"End on a clean hero frame with 'KAIRO SUSHI' and 'VISIT TONIGHT' as the primary CTA."},{"severity":"MEDIUM","category":"Pacing","timestamp_seconds":2,"problem":"The early section lingers on face reaction content instead of keeping food momentum front-loaded.","fix":"Compress the reaction material or remove it entirely so the first 1.5 seconds stay product-dominant."}]
